  <main class="pt-32 pb-24 px-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <header class="mb-12">
      <span class="text-[#06D6A0] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs mb-4 block">Legal</span>
      <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#0d1c2e] tracking-tight mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-[#414754] text-lg leading-relaxed font-body">This Privacy Policy explains how Crow Systems collects, uses, and protects your personal information.</p>
    </header>

    <div className="space-y-10">
      <section>
        <h2 className="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-[#0d1c2e] mb-4">1. Introduction</h2>
        <p className="text-[#2D3748] leading-relaxed font-body text-sm">Crow Systems respects user privacy and is committed to protecting personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how information is collected, used, and protected.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 className="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-[#0d1c2e] mb-4">2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p className="text-[#2D3748] leading-relaxed font-body text-sm mb-4">We may collect:</p>
        <ul className="space-y-2 text-[#2D3748] font-body text-sm list-disc pl-6">
          <li>Name</li>
          <li>Company information</li>
          <li>Email address</li>
          <li>Phone number</li>
          <li>Consultation details</li>
          <li>Audio submissions</li>
          <li>Technical browser information</li>
          <li>Website usage analytics</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 className="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-[#0d1c2e] mb-4">3. How Information Is Used</h2>
        <p className="text-[#2D3748] leading-relaxed font-body text-sm">Collected information may be used to:</p>
        <ul className="space-y-2 text-[#2D3748] font-body text-sm list-disc pl-6 mt-2 mb-4">
          <li>Respond to inquiries</li>
          <li>Provide consulting services</li>
          <li>Improve website functionality</li>
          <li>Process submissions</li>
          <li>Send requested communications</li>
          <li>Maintain security and reliability</li>
        </ul>
        <p className="text-[#2D3748] leading-relaxed font-body text-sm"><strong>Crow Systems does not sell personal information.</strong></p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 className="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-[#0d1c2e] mb-4">4. Audio Submission Handling</h2>
        <p className="text-[#2D3748] leading-relaxed font-body text-sm">Audio recordings submitted through the website may be temporarily stored and processed for consultation review purposes. Users should avoid submitting highly sensitive, confidential, or regulated information unless a formal agreement is in place.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 className="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-[#0d1c2e] mb-4">5. Cookies &amp; Analytics</h2>
        <p className="text-[#2D3748] leading-relaxed font-body text-sm mb-4">The website may use:</p>
        <ul className="space-y-2 text-[#2D3748] font-body text-sm list-disc pl-6">
          <li>Essential cookies</li>
          <li>Performance analytics</li>
          <li>Anonymous usage tracking</li>
        </ul>
        <p className="text-[#2D3748] leading-relaxed font-body text-sm mt-4">Analytics data is used to improve user experience and website performance.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 className="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-[#0d1c2e] mb-4">6. Third-Party Providers</h2>
        <p className="text-[#2D3748] leading-relaxed font-body text-sm">Crow Systems may use third-party providers for hosting, file storage, form processing, analytics, and email delivery. These providers may process data according to their own privacy policies.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 className="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-[#0d1c2e] mb-4">7. Data Security</h2>
        <p className="text-[#2D3748] leading-relaxed font-body text-sm">Crow Systems implements reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect submitted information. However, no online system can guarantee absolute security.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 className="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-[#0d1c2e] mb-4">8. Data Retention</h2>
        <p className="text-[#2D3748] leading-relaxed font-body text-sm">Information is retained only as long as necessary for business operations, legal obligations, service delivery, and security monitoring. Unused or outdated information may be periodically deleted.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 className="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-[#0d1c2e] mb-4">9. User Rights</h2>
        <p className="text-[#2D3748] leading-relaxed font-body text-sm mb-4">Users may request:</p>
        <ul className="space-y-2 text-[#2D3748] font-body text-sm list-disc pl-6 mb-4">
          <li>Access to their personal information</li>
          <li>Correction of inaccurate data</li>
          <li>Deletion requests where applicable</li>
          <li>Communication preferences updates</li>
        </ul>
        <p className="text-[#2D3748] leading-relaxed font-body text-sm">Requests may be submitted to <a href="mailto:privacy@crowsys.chrislabs.net" className="text-[#005ab5] hover:underline font-medium">privacy@crowsys.chrislabs.net</a>.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 className="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-[#0d1c2e] mb-4">10. International Users</h2>
        <p className="text-[#2D3748] leading-relaxed font-body text-sm">Users accessing the website from outside the operating region acknowledge that information may be processed in jurisdictions different from their own.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 className="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-[#0d1c2e] mb-4">11. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p className="text-[#2D3748] leading-relaxed font-body text-sm">The website and services are not intended for children under 13 years of age. Crow Systems does not knowingly collect information from children.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 className="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-[#0d1c2e] mb-4">12. Changes to Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p className="text-[#2D3748] leading-relaxed font-body text-sm">This Privacy Policy may be updated periodically. Updates will be posted on this page with a revised effective date.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 className="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-[#0d1c2e] mb-4">13. Contact Information</h2>
        <p className="text-[#2D3748] leading-relaxed font-body text-sm">Questions regarding privacy may be directed to <a href="mailto:privacy@crowsys.chrislabs.net" className="text-[#005ab5] hover:underline font-medium">privacy@crowsys.chrislabs.net</a>.</p>
      </section>
